 \nWelcome to our new Friday Night Draft Indoor Volleyball League\, this le
 ague will contain 2 divisions containing of players of the following skill
  levels:\n\nCOMPETITIVE DIVISION:\nA – Advanced. Experienced and competi
 tive players who execute plays consistently at a high level.\nB – Upper 
 Intermediate. Above average players who can bump\, set and spike consisten
 tly.\n\nRECREATIONAL DIVISION:\nC – Lower Intermediate. Improving player
 s who inconsistently perform 3 hits and can't spike with power.\nD – Nov
 ice / Beginner. Recreational players who are learning the rules and basic 
 skills of the game.\n\nOUT Sports League provides fun\, recreation\, and s
 ocial sports league to Central Florida's LGBTQ+ community. Our Indoor Voll
 eyball league is designed to be inclusive of people of skill levels and ba
 ckgrounds. We offer a Social Division (for beginners or players interested
  in a relaxed\, fun atmosphere)\, and a Competitive Divisions (only player
 s with prior indoor volleyball experience who are secure in the rules are 
 encouraged to play in the competitive division). All of our leagues offer 
 a great opportunity to meet other people in our community in a fun\, frien
 dly\, and accepting atmosphere. Following the games we'll go to District D
 ive where you'll get a FREE DRINK ticket every week.\n\nThis is a Draft/Re
 mix League where all players register as an INDIVIDUAL. All players may na
 me one (1) other player during registration that they'd like to be placed 
