 e.\n\n❤️ 🧡 💛 💚 💙 💜🖤\n\nLEAGUE INFORMATION\n\n8 Week 
 Indoor Volleyball Season\nFridays from October 2 - December 4th\n  - No G
 ames November 6th\nCompetitive (A/B) and Recreational (C/D) Divisions\nMat
 ches will start at 6:20\, 7:10 and 8:00pm\n\n- 12 Teams Maximum with divis
 ions determined by registration\n- Recreational Teams will have 9 players
 \, Competitive Teams will have 8 players.\n- 6v6 matches with standard rot
 ating rules\, no libero players and rally scoring\n- Games are to 21 (win 
 by 2 or first to 25). Always play all 3 games.\n- All games are refereed. 
