 a friend?\nIn a Draft/Remix Season players are permitted to list one (1) o
 ther player that they'd like to be placed on a team with. Please make sure
  you and your friend list each other when prompted during registration. C
 hains of friends are not permitted.\n\nFAQ\n\nI don't have a team\, can I 
 still play?\nYes\, register as an Individual and we will place you with a 
 team.\n\nI will miss a few weeks\, can I still play?\nYes\, all teams have
  extra players on them just in case you're absent on a given week. Teams c
 an also use substitute players.\n\nHow do I make sure my friend and I play
  on the same team?\nDuring registration there is a field where you can lis
 t the friend you want to play with and the league will place you together.
 \n\nI don't know how to play or don't think I'll be very good\, should I p
 lay?\nYes\, join our Wednesday or Friday Night leagues aimed at new and de
 veloping players and you will learn the basics in a fun\, encouraging envi
 ronment.\n\nI'm not LGBTQ+\, can I still play?\nYes\, we are accepting to 
 all people as long as you consider yourself an ally to our community.\n\nM
 ore info: https://outsportsleague.leagueapps.com/leagues/volleyball-(indoo
 r)/5151699-fridays---draftremix-league-abcd
LOCATION:Dover Shores Community Center
URL:https://outsportsleague.leagueapps.com/leagues/volleyball-(indoor)/515
