UID:Out_Sports_League-Orlando_Friday_SAND_VOLLEYBALL-2026-10-23T18:20:00
DESCRIPTION:STILL ACCEPTING PLAYERS IN THE SOCIAL DIVISION!\n\nWelcome to 
 OUT Sports League SAND VOLLEYBALL!\n\nCome join us on Friday nights at Fes
 tival Park where we'll be playing on the sand and under the lights startin
 g at 6:20pm. The league will contain 2 divisions\, Social and Competitive
 \, to accommodate players of any skill level. Don't have a team? Or have a
  few friends who want to play together? Register as a FREE AGENT and mee
 t some people! Or get some friends together and start a TEAM (see details 
 below). Following the games we'll go to District Dive where you'll get a F
 REE DRINK ticket every week.\n\nThis season OUT Sports League is sponsored
  by Pineapple Healthcare!\n\nLEAGUE INFORMATION\n\n8 Week Beach Volleyball
  Season\nFridays from October 2 - November 20\nDepending on the amount of 
 teams\, matches will start at 6:20\, 7:05\, 7:50\, 8:40 and 9:30\n\nMatche
 s will be 5 vs 5.\n20 Teams Maximum with minimum of 7 people per team. (W
 hen the league hits capacity (150 players) registration will close and Fre
 e Agents will be assigned to incomplete teams.)\nThe League contains 2 div
 isions: Social and Competitive\n\nGames are played at:\nOrlando Festival P
 ark Beach Volleyball Courts\n400 Festival Way\, Orlando\, FL 32803\n\nWe w
 ill use standard rotating rules and rally scoring\nGames are to 21 (win by
  2 or first to 25)\nAlways play all 3 games\nIf time is short\, play 3rd g
 ame to first to 15 points\n\nLEAGUE REGISTRATION INFO\n\n$50 per player 
 \nLeague Fee Covers - T-Shirt\, Lights\, Courts\, Equipment\, Awards\, Ins
 urance\, Weekly After Party!\n\nTEAM CAPTAIN* - Create a team of 7+ and in
 vite your friends! \nTEAM PLAYER - Join an existing team (please only joi
 n if invited to a team)\nFREE AGENT   - Don't have a team? No problem! Re
 gister without a team and you can list friends you want to play with. When
  league registration closes you will placed on a team.\n\nWant to play wit
 h a few friends?\nIf you have a buddy or a small group of friends who want
  to play together you can all register as Free Agents. During registration
  you will be prompted to list player(s) that you'd like to play with. Ever
 yone should register separately and the league will then place you and you
 r friends together on a team.\n\n*When the league hits capacity (150 playe
 rs) or registration closes\, Free Agents will be added to incomplete team
 s to get their rosters to a minimum of 7 players.\n\nOTHER INFO\n\nNo skil
 l or prior experience is required.\nWeekly After Party will be at District
  Dive.\n\nAll participants in all leagues and events should have their own
  insurance otherwise you will play at your own risk. OUT Sports League DOE
 S NOT provide insurance for participants. ALL participants are required to
  sign a waiver during registration. Any player who does not sign the OUT S
 ports League Waiver will not be allowed to participate\, no exceptions are
  made. The only insurance provided by OUT Sports League is the required in
 surance for the contracts to rent and utilize the playing facilities.\n\nF
