 d the league will place you together.\n\nI don't know how to play or don't
  think I'll be very good\, should I play?\nYes\, join our social division 
 and you will learn the basics in a fun\, encouraging environment.\n\nI'm n
 ot LGBTQ+\, can I still play?\nYes\, we are accepting to all people as lon
 g as you consider yourself an ally to our community.\n\nAny other question
 s? Contact us at info@outsportsleague.com\n\nMore info: https://outsportsl
